CEEBXITB TITLE 'CEL Assembler User Exit under CMS'                      00001000
***************************************************************         00002000
*                     Module Function Box                     *         00003000
*                     -------------------                     *         00004000
*                                                             *         00005000
* Module ID  - CEEBXITB.                                      *         00006000
*                                                             *         00007000
* Function   - Language Environment User Exit.                *         00008000
*                                                             *         00009000
* Function codes -                                            *         00010000
*    1 - First enclave initialization                         *         00011000
*    2 - First enclave termination                            *         00012000
*    3 - Nested enclave initialization                        *         00013000
*    4 - Nested enclave termination                           *         00014000
*    5 - Process Termination                                  *         00015000
*                                                             *         00016000
* Register Usage:                                             *         00017000
*  Input                                                      *         00018000
*    R1  - A(A(Assembler User Exit Plist cntrl blk)) - CEEAUE *         00019000
*          NOTE: CEEAUE  contains the address of a 256 Byte   *         00020000
*                work area initialized to zero which is used  *         00021000
*                as the CEEBXITA's Save Area                  *         00022000
*    R15 - Entry Point Address                                *         00023000
*    R14 - Return Address                                     *         00024000
*    R12 - Pointer to CAA                                     *         00025000
* Output                                                      *         00026000
*    CEEAUE  altered                                          *         00027000
* Work Regs                                                   *         00028000
*    R3 - Code Base                                           *         00029000
*    R5 - Base for User Exit Control Block (CEEAUE)           *         00030000
*                                                             *         00031000
* Called by  - Language Environment.                          *         00032000
*                                                             *         00033000
* Calling to - None.                                          *         00034000
*                                                             *         00035000
* Notes      - (1) .......................................... *         00036000
*                                                             *         00037000
*              (2) .......................................... *         00038000
*                                                             *         00039000
* Name       - Neale Ferguson.                                *         00040000
*                                                             *         00041000
* Date       - June, 2026.                                    *         00042000
*                                                             *         00043000
* Associated    - (1) z/VM: 7.4 Language Environment User's   *         00044000
* Documentation       Guide                                   *         00045000
*                                                             *         00046000
*                                                             *         00047000
***************************************************************         00048000
  SPACE 1                                                               00049000
